    <string name="how_title">How it works</string>
    <string name="how_desc">As you type in any app, LingualKeys shows a live translation in your chosen language in the bar above the keyboard.\n\n• If you type in English, the translation appears romanized so you can actually read and pronounce it\n• Tap the 🔊 button to hear it spoken aloud\n• Tap the translation to copy it\n• Use the 🎤 button for voice input\n• Swipe across letters to type words\n\nChange languages anytime in Settings.</string>

